---
// Root → default locale. Astro static: meta refresh + JS; Pages `_redirects` handles it server-side.
---
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/en/"><link rel="canonical" href="/en/"><script is:inline>location.replace('/en/'+location.search+location.hash)</script></head><body><a href="/en/">Buatinweb.site</a></body></html>
